  description: 
  sentences:
    nameNPC: "\u0110inh \u0110i\u1EC1n"
    Lines:
    - "\u0110inh B\u1ED9 L\u0129nh \u0111\u1EE9ng gi\u1EEFa c\u01A1n h\u1ED7n lo\u1EA1n,
      m\u01B0a \u0111\u1EADp v\xE0o m\u1EB7t, \xE1o gi\xE1p \u01B0\u1EDBt s\u0169ng.
      Tay v\u1EABn n\u1EAFm ch\u1EB7t c\xE1n c\u1EDD. M\u1EAFt nh\xECn ra ph\xEDa
      c\u1EA7u g\xE3y, r\u1ED3i quay sang nh\xECn qu\xE2n s\u0129 \u0111ang tan r\xE3.\nIm
      l\u1EB7ng.\n\xC2m thanh xung quanh nh\u01B0 ch\u1EADm l\u1EA1i. Ch\u1EC9 c\xF2n
      nghe ti\u1EBFng tim \u0111\u1EADp:\nTh\xF9m... th\xF9m... th\xF9m..."
    - "Trong l\xFAc n\xE0y, \u1EDF b\xEAn ph\xEDa c\u1EE7a Tr\u1EA7n L\xE3m."
